(865,1621,$mw$A7B1DEF04242482C0ECC47FB2107C3A659C8C4E774B80578904D3804A82991E1$mw$,$mw$7a72186135771badb24be5c4f282b1c8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1621,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":88,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أي معادلة تمثل مجموعة نقاط تبعد ثلاث وحدات عن (1,2)؟","TitleEn":"Which equation describes all points at distance 3 from (1,2)?","QuestionTextAr":"أي معادلة تمثل مجموعة نقاط تبعد ثلاث وحدات عن (1,2)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Which equation describes all points at distance 3 from (1,2)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مجموعة نقاط تبعد مسافة ثابتة r عن نقطة (h,k) هي دائرة معادلتها (س−h)²+(ص−k)²=r². المركز (1،2) والمسافة 3؛ بالتعويض (س−1)²+(ص−2)²=3²=9. هذه تمثل جميع النقاط المطلوبة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The locus of points at fixed distance r from (h,k) is a circle satisfying (x−h)² + (y−k)² = r². With center (1,2) and distance 3, substitute to get (x−1)² + (y−2)² = 9.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6473,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6474,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(x+1)^2+(y+2)^2=9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6475,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(x-1)^2+(y+2)^2=9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6476,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المركز والمسافة الثابتة.","En":"Identify the center and fixed distance."},{"Ar":"اكتب مربع المسافة من النقطة العامة إلى المركز وساوِه بمربع المسافة.","En":"Write the squared distance from a general point to the center and equate it to the squared distance."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أي معادلة تمثل مجموعة نقاط تبعد ثلاث وحدات عن (1,2)؟","En":"Which equation describes all points at distance 3 from (1,2)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=3","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الطرف الأيمن 3 يعطي نصف قطر جذر 3.","En":"Right side three gives radius square root of three."}},{"LatexCode":"(x+1)^2+(y+2)^2=9","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا ا