},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقطة الثابتة هي المركز (1,2) والمسافة الموجبة ثلاثة.","En":"The fixed point is center (1,2), with positive distance three."},{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2}=3$","En":"$\\sqrt{(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2}=3$"},{"Ar":"نربع الطرفين؛ بما أن الطرفين غير سالبين تبقى المعادلة مكافئة.","En":"Square both sides; both are nonnegative, so equivalence is preserved."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$","En":"$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"ربع المسافة الثابتة وانتبه لإشارات المركز.","En":"Square the fixed distance and preserve center signs."},"FormulaLatex":"d=\\sqrt{(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$","En":"$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4-1)^2+(2-2)^2=9$","En":"$(4-1)^2+(2-2)^2=9$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الطرف الأيمن 3 يعطي نصف قطر جذر 3.","En":"Right side three gives radius square root of three."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار مركزه (−1,−2).","En":"This option has center (−1,−2)."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار مركزه (1,−2).","En":"This option has center (1,−2)."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مجموعة النقاط ذات المسافة الثابتة عن نقطة هي دائرة.

$d=\sqrt{(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2}$

1. النقطة الثابتة هي المركز (1,2) والمسافة الموجبة ثلاثة.

2. $\sqrt{(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2}=3$

3. نربع الطرفين؛ بما أن الطرفين غير سالبين تبقى المعادلة مكافئة.

$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$

$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4-1)^2+(2-2)^2=9$

ربع المسافة الثابتة وانتبه لإشارات المركز.$mw$,$mw$Points at a fixed distance from a point form a circle.

$d=\sqrt{(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2}$

1. The fixed point is center (1,2), with positive distance three.

2. $\sqrt{(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2}=3$

3. Square both sides; both are nonnegative, so equivalence is preserved.

$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$

$(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=9$ Dimensionless

$(4-1)^2+(2-2)^2=9$

Square the fixed distance and preserve center signs.$mw$),
(866,1622,$mw$B795B9DF77EFB09295EBA7EEC66D0938E513CDB2D42C07D6395CC1C979344F2C$mw$,$mw$f448c4ebf65d401b09b2397c83a942fb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1622,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":88,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"طرفا قطعة رأسية هما (0,-2) و(0,6). ما معادلة منصفها العمودي؟","TitleEn":"A vertical segment joins (0,-2) and (0,6). What is its perpendicular bisector?","QuestionTextAr":"طرفا قطعة رأسية هما (0,-2) و(0,6). ما معادلة منصفها العمودي؟","QuestionTextEn":"A vertical segment joins (0,-2) and (0,6). What is its perpendicular bisector?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: العمود المنصف لقطعة مستقيمة يمر بمنتصفها ويكون عمودياً على اتجاهها. القطعة من (0،−2) إلى (0،6) رأسية، ومنتصفها (0،(−2+6)/2) = (0،2). العمود عليها أفقي، لذا معادلته ص = 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A perpendicular bisector passes through a segment's midpoint and is perpendicular to the segment. From (0,−2) to (0,6) the segment is vertical; its midpoint is (0,(−2+6)/2) = (0,2). The bisector is horizontal: y = 2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6477,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"x=2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6478,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"y=2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6479,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"y=0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6480,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"x=0","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد اتجاه القطعة ومنتصفها.","En":"Identify the segment direction and midpoint."},{"Ar":"ارسم ذهنياً مستقيمًا عمودياً على القطعة ماراً بمنتصفها.","En":"Construct the line perpendicular to the segment through its midpoint."}],"Title":{"Ar":"طرفا قطعة رأسية هما (0,-2) و(0,6). ما معادلة منصفها العمودي؟","En":"A vertical segment joins (0,-2) and (0,6). What is its perpendicular bisector?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"x=2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x=2 رأسي وموازٍ للقطعة.","En":"x=2 is vertical and parallel to the segment."}},{"LatexCode":"y=2","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"y=0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"y=0 لا يمر بالمنتصف.","En":"y=0 misses the midpoint."}},{"LatexCode":"x=0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x=0 يحمل القطعة نفسها.","En":"x=0 contains the segment itself."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"طرفا قطعة رأسية هما (0,-2) و(0,6). ما معادلة منصفها العمودي؟","En":"A vertical segment joins (0,-2) and (0,6). What is its perpendicular bisector?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المنصف العمودي يمر بالمنتصف ويعامد القطعة؛ لذلك يكون أفقياً للقطعة الرأسية.","En":"The perpendicular bisector passes through the midpoint and is horizontal for a vertical segment."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القطعة رأسية لأن إحداثيي x متساويان؛ منتصفها (0,2).","En":"The segment is vertical because its x-coordinates match; its midpoint is (0,2)."},{"Ar":"$M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$","En":"$M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$"},{"Ar":"المستقيم العمودي على قطعة رأسية أفقي، ويمر بالمنتصف عند y=2.","En":"A perpendicular to a vertical segment is horizontal and passes through the midpoint at y=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$y=2$","En":"$y=2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط اتجاه القطعة باتجاه منصفها العمودي.","En":"Do not confuse the segment direction with its perpendicular bisector."},"FormulaLatex":"M=((x_1+x_2)/2,(y_1+y_2)/2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y=2$","En":"$y=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$","En":"$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":88,"PrimarySkillId":330,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد اتجاه القطعة ومنتصفها.","En":"Identify the segment direction and midpoint."},{"Ar":"ارسم ذهنياً مستقيمًا عمودياً على القطعة ماراً بمنتصفها.","En":"Construct the line perpendicular to the segment through its midpoint."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المنصف العمودي يمر بالمنتصف ويعامد القطعة؛ لذلك يكون أفقياً للقطعة الرأسية.","En":"The perpendicular bisector passes through the midpoint and is horizontal for a vertical segment."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القطعة رأسية لأن إحداثيي x متساويان؛ منتصفها (0,2).","En":"The segment is vertical because its x-coordinates match; its midpoint is (0,2)."},{"Ar":"$M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$","En":"$M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$"},{"Ar":"المستقيم العمودي على قطعة رأسية أفقي، ويمر بالمنتصف عند y=2.","En":"A perpendicular to a vertical segment is horizontal and passes through the midpoint at y=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$y=2$","En":"$y=2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط اتجاه القطعة باتجاه منصفها العمودي.","En":"Do not confuse the segment direction with its perpendicular bisector."},"FormulaLatex":"M=((x_1+x_2)/2,(y_1+y_2)/2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y=2$","En":"$y=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$","En":"$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x=2 رأسي وموازٍ للقطعة.","En":"x=2 is vertical and parallel to the segment."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"y=0 لا يمر بالمنتصف.","En":"y=0 misses the midpoint."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x=0 يحمل القطعة نفسها.","En":"x=0 contains the segment itself."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المنصف العمودي يمر بالمنتصف ويعامد القطعة؛ لذلك يكون أفقياً للقطعة الرأسية.

$M=((x_1+x_2)/2,(y_1+y_2)/2)$

1. القطعة رأسية لأن إحداثيي x متساويان؛ منتصفها (0,2).

2. $M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$

3. المستقيم العمودي على قطعة رأسية أفقي، ويمر بالمنتصف عند y=2.

$y=2$

$y=2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$

لا تخلط اتجاه القطعة باتجاه منصفها العمودي.$mw$,$mw$The perpendicular bisector passes through the midpoint and is horizontal for a vertical segment.

$M=((x_1+x_2)/2,(y_1+y_2)/2)$

1. The segment is vertical because its x-coordinates match; its midpoint is (0,2).

2. $M=(0,(-2+6)/2)=(0,2)$

3. A perpendicular to a vertical segment is horizontal and passes through the midpoint at y=2.

$y=2$

$y=2$ Dimensionless

$(2+2)^2=(2-6)^2=16$

Do not confuse the segment direction with its perpendicular bisector.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" x WHERE x."Id"<>b.draft AND x."EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn') AND (x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,Ar}'=p."QuestionTextAr" OR x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,En}'=p."QuestionTextEn")) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Open draft duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
